-- The Mechanoid briefing: what the Mechanoids will pay for.
-- Rewritten from Benson Script 13, which entering Room 102 starts.

use show, report from benson

constant room = "mechanoid briefing"

-- Walking back in while the briefing plays doesn't start it again.
on entered place where place = room, dropping
  report ["MECHANOID BRIEFING ROOM", "WE WILL PAY", "FOR PALYAR REQUIREMENTS",
    "WHEN DELIVERED TO OUR", "CONTROL IN THIS COMPLEX"] and wait
  -- The rest is only for a player who stayed to hear it.
  ask world to here
  if it is not room then return
  report ["WE MAY ALSO PAY FOR", "DESTRUCTION OF SELECTED",
    "PALYAR INSTALLATIONS", "BRIEFING ENDS"] and wait
end entered
